WHERE id = 'd1c3921e-f4af-423e-b912-9a9fb9435a25' AND scene = 'Enchanted candy alcove with floor-to-ceiling candy cane jars, shimmering cobwebs, crimson candles flickering on copper trays, carved pumpkins radiating orange light, garlands of black licorice twisting overhead.';

UPDATE public.holiday_scenes SET scene = 'The lacquered door frames a tunnel opening into a kitchen where a witch''s candy cottage bakes itself, walls expanding and icing spreading autonomously. Licorice-twist columns grow from the floor, spiraling toward a black button moon visible through a sugar-glass window. Purple fog leaks from the oven, pooling on checkered tiles. Felt wallpaper breathes steadily as the wool cat watches frosting roses bloom in time-lapse, their petals shifting from violet to toxic pink, delicious and dangerous.'
WHERE id = '20aabc8c-918e-46de-9b31-214ebd33e147' AND scene = 'The lacquered door frames a tunnel opening into a kitchen where a gingerbread house bakes itself, walls expanding and icing spreading autonomously. Candy cane columns grow from the floor, spiraling toward a black button moon visible through a sugar-glass window. Purple fog leaks from the oven, pooling on checkered tiles. Felt wallpaper breathes steadily as the wool cat watches frosting roses bloom in time-lapse, their petals shifting from violet to toxic pink, delicious and dangerous.';

